## Repo layout (single Astro app at root)

Product code lives under `src/`. Alias `@/` → `src/`.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `src/pages/` | Astro routes (thin; compose features), all static |
| `src/features/` | Visitor jobs (`<entity>-<objective>/`) + `site-shell` chrome |
| `src/data/` | `data/<Entity>/` reads + `dto` transforms |
| `src/services/` | `services/shopify` Storefront API client |
| `src/content/` | FAQ markdown (content collection) |
| `src/utilities/` | Shared pure helpers |
| `src/stores/` | Client stores (Nano Stores: cart id) |

No `packages/` workspaces: no sibling consumer, no shared-package tier.

## Feature MVC (`src/features/<entity>-<objective>/`)

Noun-first: `product-browse`, `cart-manage`.

```text
features/{entity}-{objective}/
  models/              Zod for this job only
  views/components/    presentational TSX / Astro
  hooks/               non-form UI hooks
  api/                 client calls to our own API routes
  utilities/           pure helpers — not in views/
  types/               only if not inferable from models
  tests/               Vitest for this job — never `*.test.ts` beside source
  config.ts            optional
```

Omit empty dirs. Add `views/pages/`, `controllers/`, `views/phases/` only when a feature needs them. Shared chrome stays `features/site-shell`. Business rules live in Shopify, not here.

## Import law

Enforced in `eslint.config.mjs` (`import/no-cycle`, `no-restricted-imports`). Matches `.cursor/rules/layers.mdc`.

Forbidden: services → data/feature. feature → sibling feature internals. Barrel `index.ts` re-exports. Storefront API calls outside `services/shopify`.

Pages may **compose** multiple features. Features must not import sibling internals.

PR: correct layer, no forbidden imports, no new barrels, `pnpm lint` passes.
